  "title": "Native DFlash2 K=7 on RTX 3090 and RTX 4090: RTX 3090 passes the 108-role and 7-supplemental decode gates (x1.29968, min case 0.97987) and the 131,072-token INT8 fit and true-cold durability proof at 21,968 MiB peak with 768 MiB headroom; RTX 4090 clears the aggregate bar (x1.26362) but fails the 0.95 per-case floor on log-024@0 (0.945889, reproduced in isolation at 0.9451)",
  "generated_utc": "2026-10-27T13:50:00Z",
  "status": "completed_with_limits",
  "question": "With the W8 static shared-memory device-link blocker removed and a load-time sm_86/sm_89 DFlash2 fit seam (Q8_G32_FP16 to Q4_G64_FP16 draft MLP gate/up requantization plus host-mapped token_embedding), does DFlash2 K=7 clear the preregistered 108-role decode gate (weighted >= 1.08, every case >= 0.95) and the 7-case supplemental suite on the native Windows RTX 3090 and RTX 4090 lanes, and does the passing lane fit 131,072 INT8 KV tokens with true-cold checkpoint durability?",
  "answer": "RTX 3090 passed every speed, fit, and true-cold durability bar; RTX 4090 passed the aggregate speed bar and all 7 supplementals but missed the 0.95 per-case floor on one case (log-024@0). On frozen v0.13.1 control binaries (7a25cd72 on upstream 64d10fbf, model v3 81f924d4, 65,536 INT8 KV, concurrency 1, chunk 1,024, extra device state slots 0), RTX 3090 at 350 W decoded the 108-role corpus at 102.60 vs 78.94 tok/s (weighted x1.29968, minimum case ratio 0.97987 on log-024@0, 0 cases below 0.95) and the 7 supplementals at 95.10 vs 74.58 tok/s (weighted x1.27512, minimum case 1.10042). RTX 4090 at 450 W decoded the 108-role corpus at 174.85 vs 138.37 tok/s (weighted x1.26362) and the 7 supplementals at 164.12 vs 131.16 tok/s (weighted x1.25136, minimum case 1.05885), but log-024@0 landed at 127.73 vs 135.03 tok/s (ratio 0.945889); an authorized isolated 4-arm ABBA reproduced the regression at 127.98 vs 135.41 tok/s (median ratio 0.945090, range 0.945011-0.945169). Admitted to 131,072-token fit qualification on source e456af37b (cleanly rebased into shipped source 2c6f423b as 059e73b6), RTX 3090 passed the real GPU mapped-loading oracle (17,852,965,376 B device weights, 1,350,860,800 B host-mapped token_embedding, 1,467,318,272 B device weight savings vs the unquantized-draft 65,536-token startup profile) and started three consecutive 131,072-token INT8 processes with 805,306,368 B (768 MiB) retained KV capacity headroom, 1,758,461,952 B (1,677 MiB) available after startup, and 21,968.0 MiB peak VRAM across 376 samples at 349.99 W peak. Its v4 true-cold durability proof exported an authenticated 3,066-token checkpoint (691,580,046 B, 48 pages, 3 states, 3 points), verified a separate fresh cold-reference process with 0 cached tokens and 3,090 computed prefill tokens against a restored process reusing 3,066 tokens (24 computed), and matched all 32 generated token IDs and 114 UTF-8 output bytes (sha256 07b8db1f) with 0 refused saves.",
  "decision": {
    "action": "Merge the native DFlash2 engine support and load-time fit seam into shared source 2c6f423b (v0.14.0) with DFlash2 off by default; keep both published v0.14.0 native lane specs on MTP3 while staging the RTX 3090 DFlash2 K=7 lane-profile switch and RTX 4090 log-024@0 investigation for the next release",
    "rule": "Preregistered P14 S3 gate: 108-role ABBA (84 cases at depth 0, 12 at 32,000, 12 at 64,000) requires weighted decode ratio >= 1.08 and every case ratio >= 0.95; the 7-case supplemental suite is required separately; only a passing card advances to 131,072-token INT8 fit and true-cold durability qualification (kv_capacity_headroom_bytes and available_after_startup_bytes >= 805,306,368 B on RTX 3090, 0 allocation or shutdown refusals, true-cold reference with 0 cached tokens matching restored continuation token IDs and UTF-8 bytes).",
    "verdict": "RTX 3090 speed, 131K fit, and true-cold durability PASS (lane-profile switch ready, pending native powered quality screen and shipping-binary gate); RTX 4090 speed gate FAIL on single case log-024@0 (0.945889 < 0.95, reproduced at 0.945090)",
    "reason": "The engine source is unified across all three lanes in v0.14.0, and the managed native installer and package validator hard-code MTP3 and device_state_slots >= 1 in schema 4, so switching RTX 3090 to DFlash2 K=7 requires a release-spec schema update and a powered native quality screen.",
    "not_decided_here": "Native 1,120-prompt powered quality screen on the Q4-draft DFlash2 profile, RTX 4090 131,072-token fit (not run after the log-024@0 stop), and the full 131,072-token depth speed series on the final shipping binary."
  },
